       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHEBYSHEV.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DX   PIC 9(3).
       01 DY   PIC 9(3).
       01 BEST PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE DX = FUNCTION ABS(1 - 4)
           COMPUTE DY = FUNCTION ABS(2 - 6)
           COMPUTE BEST = FUNCTION MAX(DX, DY)
           DISPLAY "CHEBYSHEV = " BEST
           STOP RUN.
